Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This SDK depends on the following third-party libraries, which are
downloaded from their respective package registries at build time and are
NOT redistributed in this repository:

* OpenCV (https://opencv.org) — Apache License 2.0
  Used via the `opencv_dart` Dart bindings (Flutter) and
  `@techstark/opencv-js` WebAssembly build (Web) for document boundary
  detection, sharpness scoring, and perspective correction.

* Google ML Kit Face Detection (https://developers.google.com/ml-kit)
  Used via the `google_mlkit_face_detection` Flutter plugin for on-device
  face observation. Subject to the Google ML Kit Terms of Service.

* MediaPipe Tasks Vision (https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe) —
  Apache License 2.0. Used on the Web platform for face landmark and
  blendshape estimation.

